    "description": "Property Data Bank, Inc. provides cloud services in Japan. It offers cloud and information management services related to the operations and management of assets, facilities, and real estate; and solutions for system integration of cloud services. The company also provides real estate document management services, commercial store sales forecasting cloud services, data science services, and commissioned development services for web applications and mobile applications; and contract development services, etc. It offers @property, an integrated asset cloud that centralizes all the data necessary for real estate management; @commerce provides comprehensive support from sharing property information to market area analysis and sales forecasting; @knowledge that digitizes all kinds of documents, such as contracts and invoices; and @cmms streamlines maintenance and inspection operations; @iwms enables centralized management of all workplaces. In addition, the company offers PDB integration solution, real estate management DX utilizing BIM, and speed answer solutions, as well as consulting services, and web and mobile application development. Property Data Bank, Inc. was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Minato, Japan."
